// Come_In :
"P4047535808" "The Thorns have no business with weapons.  Time to get rid of them."
// Come_In :
"P715337129" "It's going to be a bad day for The Circle of Thorns."
// Come_In :
"P3069954114" "Huh.  The cave door was unguarded.  That's not smart."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - Guard_Guy_Inactive 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Guard_Guy_Inactive :
"P3781412217" "So many possibilities.  Use or sell.  Either way, we win."
// Guard_Guy_Inactive :
"P4217339999" "Make sure the patrols are constant.  I don't want any heroes surprising us."
// Guard_Guy_Inactive :
"P1418438761" "This shipment is a great boon for us.  So many possibilities."
// Guard_Guy_Inactive :
"P3609721056" "No one is to touch this weapons shipment until we determine how we are going to proceed."
// Guard_Guy_Inactive :
"P1295276342" "I can see the fireworks now.  Those Freedom Corps never knew we had the shipment until we were already gone."
// Guard_Guy_Inactive :
"P2434929059" "Stay here.  Watch the crate.  No one touches it."
// Guard_Guy_Inactive :
"P3030084297" "We will cause great pain with this."
// Guard_Guy_Inactive :
"P4154085828" "Oh I can't wait until we can use this."
// Guard_Guy_Inactive :
"P1095196070" "Just another little reminder to Freedom Corps never to underestimate the Circle of Thorns.<em>Heh heh heh."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - Guard_Guy_2_Inactive 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Guard_Guy_2_Inactive :
"P1800500833" "Agreed."
// Guard_Guy_2_Inactive :
"P2669644259" "Too true."
// Guard_Guy_2_Inactive :
"P3981357706" "Absolutely."
// Guard_Guy_2_Inactive :
"P352057129" "It is as you say."
// Guard_Guy_2_Inactive :
"P2358410442" "Mm.  Yes, you are right."
// Guard_Guy_2_Inactive :
"P3850158084" "We understand each other."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - Guard_Guy_Alert 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Guard_Guy_Alert :
"P276008840" "Pesky hero!"
// Guard_Guy_Alert :
"P3980864931" "Don't let {HeroName} get to the shipment!"
// Guard_Guy_Alert :
"P2322843442" "Heads will roll!"
// Guard_Guy_Alert :
"P2029272485" "Not today, hero!"
// Guard_Guy_Alert :
"P3720814351" "How did you get in here?"
// Guard_Guy_Alert :
"P1270781136" "How did you find us?"
// Guard_Guy_Alert :
"P1187484571" "Inconceivable!"

