// Guard_Guy_Inactive :
"P308317657" "I look forward to the endless possibilities for pain with this."
// Guard_Guy_Inactive :
"P2959984649" "I do hope a hero drops by.  Then we can give him great pain for FUN!"
// Guard_Guy_Inactive :
"P1411007231" "Don't touch anything until we know what we're doing with this.  Heads will roll. <em>Which could be kind of fun."
// Guard_Guy_Inactive :
"P1437286374" "I love getting past the Freedom Corps.  Now we can use this stuff against them.  How delicious is that?"
// Guard_Guy_Inactive :
"P872777491" "I hope the heroes come for this.  You know they will.  Think there'll be a blood bath?<em>Oh I do hope so!"
// Guard_Guy_Inactive :
"P598809736" "Just another little reminder to Freedom Corps that they're not as clever as they might think.<em>Heh heh heh."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - Guard_Guy_2_Inactive 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Guard_Guy_2_Inactive :
"P288011152" "You got it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - Guard_Guy_Alert 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Guard_Guy_Alert :
"P840862060" "Let the festivities begin!"
// Guard_Guy_Alert :
"P2979574494" "Oh my.  A hero.  I am so surprised.  What will I do now?"
// Guard_Guy_Alert :
"P1957577147" "Let's get to the business of that head rolling issue now."
// Guard_Guy_Alert :
"P2403574438" "Oh look.  A hero.  Gee, there's a shock."
// Guard_Guy_Alert :
"P2234514386" "Oh goodie!  A hero!  Right on time!  Just like you said!"
// Guard_Guy_Alert :
"P4250282734" "Golly.  You've found our secret lair and the weapons stash.  Whatever will we do now?<em>Fighting sounds good."
// Guard_Guy_Alert :
"P795667324" "Ha ha ha!  Here comes {HeroName}!  Right on time!"

