"P2563456177" "<span align=center><font face=title><color yellow>Weapons Destruction Notice</font></color></span><br><br>Attention:  Meg Mason, PPD Liaison<br><br>The Freedom Corps Security Coalition has issued a weapons destruction notice.  One of their security warehouses in {Port_Name} has been broken into and a large shipment of weapons was stolen.  The  shipment has been tracked to The Hollows and is flagged 'for immediate destruction.'  Please forward this information to your contacts for urgent attention.<br><br>Suspected Location:  <color deepskyblue>Caves</color><br>Gang:  <color red>Trolls</color><br>Neighborhood:  <color orange>Eastgate Heights</color><br>"

